    <h2 id="elsewhere">Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul class="elsewhere">
      <li>
        <a href="/cv/">CV</a>
        <span>What I have built, with the one or two numbers that matter.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/cdabel" rel="me">GitHub</a>
        <span>Including the <a href="https://github.com/cdabel/chrisdabeldotcom">source for this site</a>.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/critpages/">CritPages</a>
        <span>
          The critique app for unpublished writing, in beta. Built solo with
          Claude Code: Expo on the phones, Next.js on Vercel for the web,
          Supabase underneath with the access model in Postgres row-level
          security. <a href="https://critpages.com">critpages.com</a>
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.enternyxus.com/" rel="me">Writing</a>
        <span>Fiction, poetry, and essays as Cael Lawenu, on Substack.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://raisingandconnecting.com">Raising &amp; Connecting</a>
        <span>
          Books, printables, and a blog on emotional intelligence and
          neurodivergence for kids and teens.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chrisdabel" rel="me">LinkedIn</a>
        <span>The longer version, and the recommendations.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede { font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .elsewhere { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .elsewhere li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .elsewhere li { grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr; }
  }
  .elsewhere > li > a { font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .elsewhere > li > a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .elsewhere span { color: var(--muted); }
</style>
